{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-function","title":"def:busemann-function","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.md","line":243,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex#def:busemann-function","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-approx]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-antitone]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:ends-exist]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","label":"def:busemann-function","line":420,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Busemann function]\n\\label{def:busemann-function}\n\n\\source{morgan-tian}\n\\uses{def:busemann-approx, lem:busemann-approx-antitone, lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound, lem:ends-exist}\n\n\n\n\n\nThe \\emph{Busemann function} of a minimizing ray $\\lambda$ is\n$$B_\\lambda(x)=\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}B_{\\lambda,t}(x)\n=\\inf_{t\\ge0}B_{\\lambda,t}(x),$$\nwhose existence follows from monotonicity and the preceding lower bound.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Busemann function] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a627573656d616e6e2d66756e6374696f6e\"></span> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">morgan-tian</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Abusemann-approx\">↗ def:busemann-approx</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Abusemann-approx-antitone\">↗ lem:busemann-approx-antitone</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Abusemann-approx-lower-bound\">↗ lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aends-exist\">↗ lem:ends-exist</a> <p></p>The <em>Busemann function</em> of a minimizing ray <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\lambda $\">$\\lambda $</span> is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ B_\\lambda (x)=\\lim _{t\\to \\infty }B_{\\lambda ,t}(x) =\\inf _{t\\ge 0}B_{\\lambda ,t}(x), \\]\">\\[ B_\\lambda (x)=\\lim _{t\\to \\infty }B_{\\lambda ,t}(x) =\\inf _{t\\ge 0}B_{\\lambda ,t}(x), \\]</span> whose existence follows from monotonicity and the preceding lower bound. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-limit","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-approx","title":"def:busemann-approx","label":"def:busemann-approx"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-antitone","title":"lem:busemann-approx-antitone","label":"lem:busemann-approx-antitone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","title":"lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","label":"lem:bu